---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com"
  description="Terms and conditions for using FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-10">
    <div class="text-center space-y-3">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-serif">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Last Updated: November 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-md space-y-6 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-serif">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com, you acknowledge and agree to comply with these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please discontinue use of the website immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-serif">2. Nature of Service</h2>
        <p>
          FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com provides automated document design and formatting tools for personal matrimonial biodatas. We are a design utility, not a matrimonial matchmaking agency, matrimonial bureau, or dating service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-serif">3. User Responsibility & Accuracy of Information</h2>
        <p>
          Users are solely responsible for the authenticity, accuracy, and legality of any personal details, photos, or family information they enter into the biodata generator. FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com accepts no liability for inaccurate, misleading, or unauthorized data included in generated documents.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 font-serif">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All graphic themes, layout templates, CSS styles, and web software code are the intellectual property of FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com. You are granted a personal, non-exclusive license to download and print biodatas created through the service.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
